Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Flower Cave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 41
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! The Xilan Tree is about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, everyone! Use mud to prop up the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite—there aren’t enough of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.01,0:00:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to call upon the Flower Tribe to help save this tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.59,0:00:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But they hold such deep prejudices against the Silt Tribe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.62,0:00:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,they probably wouldn’t even come down to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me. I am the Elder’s favorite student.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I speak to him, he’ll listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But back then, I was also…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, reinforce it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.86,0:01:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,With all this commotion, it should be easier to convince them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll stand guard here; you guys go up and get help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s all go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, where did Planie go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually defeated the King of the Flower Bugs in a single move—that’s amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re our great hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.86,0:01:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not quite on a hero’s level, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.38,0:01:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who has helped us gets a title—just like Queen Nuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.65,0:01:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We could call you “Fresh Hunk”,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.17,0:01:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,“Big Baby”, or “Overlord”.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer you call me “Hero”.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.37,0:01:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hero, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go up and find Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.73,0:01:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Wolffy, it’s dangerous here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to help everyone here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,When you use the fragment, do you really not feel anything special?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.21,0:02:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from feeling stronger, nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I held the fragment once, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It might have different effects depending on who holds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you keep it safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s set off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Silt Tribe said using this to get up…what exactly…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Another earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Where did Xi Huahua go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the reason for these increasingly frequent earthquakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone calm down; let him explain first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I come from another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I only pretended to be Xi Huahua to retrieve a multicolored fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no “multicolored fragment” here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It really exists; it’s right there in Flower Baby’s Trial Grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of you, go check out the Trial Grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Xi Huahua?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I told you that you knocked him down the tree, would you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible. I’m a veteran flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.04,0:03:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I possibly hit someone without realizing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder, there is no fragment in the Trial Grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept your punishment until you’re willing to tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? If you don’t want to suffer, you’d better confess quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s being so stubborn…could it be that Xi Huahua was…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.20,0:03:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back Xi Huahua!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.40,0:03:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the state you’re in without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua, where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.95,0:03:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Elders, everyone—listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Xilan Tree is about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve been taking care of the Xilan Tree all along; how could it collapse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider the frequent earthquakes lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The core of the Xilan Tree has actually long since rotted away, leaving a huge hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The tremors have indeed been getting worse lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But does that prove the Xilan Tree is about to collapse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it when I was fighting alongside the Silt Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually went to the Silt Tribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the Flower Tribe’s rules, no tribesman is allowed to go to the Silt Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, they are forbidden from ever returning here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua actually broke the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Silt Tribe are actually kind and hardworking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They, too, are striving to preserve the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.45,0:04:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Silt Tribe…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It is thanks to them this time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,that I discovered the core of the Xilan Tree was actually rotting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the true cause of the earthquakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go down together and save the Xilan Tree with the Silt Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Flower Tribe is forbidden from entering the Silt Tribe’s territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a rule passed down by generations of Flower Tribe Elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I possibly change it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s still not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you guys won’t go, I’ll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to take on the Flower Cave challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll use my own strength to save the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.43,0:05:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though Xi Huahua possesses the power of Light Cotton,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,can he really take on the challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of place is the Flower Cave? A place that sells flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it! It’s recorded in the notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flower Cave can unleash the ultimate potential of a Flower Tribe member’s Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the challenge fails,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the challenger’s Spark will remain in the Flower Cave forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,becoming one of the flowers within the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is the Flower Cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua, I’ll ask you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you really decided to take on the challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I have to rely on myself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn’t so scary after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The real trial is just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.59,0:06:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s stable for now; everyone can take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I just need to get the other fragment,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.43,0:07:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I’m the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.43,0:07:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,With enough energy now, I don’t have to fear anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re from the Flower Tribe—how did you fall down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You know about the fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That belongs to my world—give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yours? I have no idea what you’re talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I feel like you’ll threaten my future plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll just have to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.36,0:07:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Got the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn’t a Flower Tribe’s abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t from the Flower Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Her Majesty run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that this Flower Tribe harmed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too risky with so many of them around; I’ll come back for the fragment later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They’ve just fainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.11,0:08:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go up there and get some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Right—ask them clearly why they hurt our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the truth out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge up there—let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:08:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that if I just pull out that flower,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be able to pass the trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My Spark is being drained away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a flower sword that feeds purely on Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If the challenge fails, your Spark gets drained, and you turn back into a Flower Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.77,0:09:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it is a sword that has gathered a massive amount of Spark
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and possesses infinite power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you want to obtain it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to find a way to overcome that powerful draining force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,if you give up now, you might still be able to save your Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not over yet; I won’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t that what you taught me, Elder?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.98,0:09:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not going to look for the Light Cotton anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,that the Light Cotton—born in the light and capable of growing in any environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,possessing infinite possibilities—was the only choice for your Spark?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,“So I only want the Light Cotton; it’s the only one that’s so colorful and diverse!”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly didn’t say it so lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never imagined the Light Cotton would be growing on that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no way I can get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not over yet—how do you know if you can do it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t forget the infinite possibilities of the Light Cotton.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t that exactly what you taught me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s no use; Xi Huahua is about to be completely absorbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Light Cotton can grow anywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,taking on any form—a Spark of infinite possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’re absorbing my Spark,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll also
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,absorb yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Witness my ultimate Light Cotton—a manifestation of infinite possibilities!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s grown another pair of wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That is powerful proof of the combined energy of all the Sparks merging within him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But he risked danger just to save Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.03,0:11:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something major really happening down there? Maybe I should go down and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:11:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t I say we didn’t know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You still won’t admit it even after seeing it with your own eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to teach you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.30,0:12:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you’re talking about, but the Flower Tribe is not to be trifled with.
